{"id":"d0c7afd20e93018d","group":"16","path":"16/16-ex-noncontextual-dtt-model.md","title":"强 DTT 结构不保证语境生成","display":"ex-noncontextual-dtt-model — 强 DTT 结构不保证语境生成","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"10","label":"16-ex-noncontextual-dtt-model","aliases":["16-ex-noncontextual-dtt-model"],"display":"ex-noncontextual-dtt-model — 强 DTT 结构不保证语境生成","depends_on":["[[16-df-split-dtt-structure]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-16","source":"Local counterexample; §10.4 pp.612–613 (PDF632–633) supplies the context/comprehension setting, not this example","verification_status":"proved-in-note","verification_basis":"Explicit two-object category; all six SplitDTT clauses checked below; induction on context extensions","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"label","html":"16-ex-noncontextual-dtt-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-ex-noncontextual-dtt-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-noncontextual-dtt-model — 强 DTT 结构不保证语境生成"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b022673471b8fbb9\" href=\"?note=b022673471b8fbb9\" title=\"16-df-split-dtt-structure\">16-df-split-dtt-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"source","html":"Local counterexample; §10.4 pp.612–613 (PDF632–633) supplies the context/comprehension setting, not this example"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"verification_basis","html":"Explicit two-object category; all six SplitDTT clauses checked below; induction on context extensions"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b022673471b8fbb9\" href=\"?note=b022673471b8fbb9\" title=\"16-df-split-dtt-structure\">16-df-split-dtt-structure</a> 的候选记录格式及谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SplitDTT}\">\\(\\mathsf{SplitDTT}\\)</span>；本例不预先假定构造的记录满足它。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1,\\mathbb N,\\le,\\varnothing\">\\(0,1,\\mathbb N,\\le,\\varnothing\\)</span> 及有序对使用集合论标准符号；范畴记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span>、见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_\\star\">\\(S_\\star\\)</span>、生成层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_n\">\\(L_n\\)</span> 和生成对象集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 均在 Assertion 中构造。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j,k,\\Gamma,\\Delta\">\\(i,j,k,\\Gamma,\\Delta\\)</span> 遍历下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span>。类型、项及构造操作只在下式指定的合法输入上定义；所有类型族、项族和操作还携带上游格式中的语境指标。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma\">\\(\\sigma:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(\\sigma)=\\Delta,t(\\sigma)=\\Gamma\">\\(s(\\sigma)=\\Delta,t(\\sigma)=\\Gamma\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO&amp;\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\},&amp;M&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in O^2\\mid i\\le j\\},\\\\\ns(i,j)&amp;\\coloneqq i,&amp;t(i,j)&amp;\\coloneqq j,\\\\\ne(i)&amp;\\coloneqq(i,i),&amp;c((j,k),(i,j))&amp;\\coloneqq(i,k),\\\\\n\\mathcal C&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O,M,s,t,e,c\\rangle,&amp;\n\\mathcal C(i,j)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\}\\cap M,\\\\\n\\mathbf1&amp;\\coloneqq1,&amp;!_\\Gamma&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Gamma,1),\\\\\nu&amp;\\coloneqq(0,0),&amp;\\star&amp;\\coloneqq(1,0).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO&amp;\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\},&amp;M&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in O^2\\mid i\\le j\\},\\\\\ns(i,j)&amp;\\coloneqq i,&amp;t(i,j)&amp;\\coloneqq j,\\\\\ne(i)&amp;\\coloneqq(i,i),&amp;c((j,k),(i,j))&amp;\\coloneqq(i,k),\\\\\n\\mathcal C&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O,M,s,t,e,c\\rangle,&amp;\n\\mathcal C(i,j)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\}\\cap M,\\\\\n\\mathbf1&amp;\\coloneqq1,&amp;!_\\Gamma&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Gamma,1),\\\\\nu&amp;\\coloneqq(0,0),&amp;\\star&amp;\\coloneqq(1,0).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{u\\},&amp;\n\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\star\\},\\\\\nu[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq u,&amp;\\star[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\\star,\\\\\n\\Gamma.u&amp;\\coloneqq\\Gamma,&amp;p_u&amp;\\coloneqq e(\\Gamma),\\\\\nq_u&amp;\\coloneqq\\star,&amp;\\langle\\sigma,\\star\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma,\\\\\n1_\\Gamma&amp;\\coloneqq u,&amp;*_\\Gamma&amp;\\coloneqq\\star,\\\\\n\\Pi_\\Gamma(u,u)&amp;\\coloneqq u,&amp;\\Sigma_\\Gamma(u,u)&amp;\\coloneqq u,\\\\\n\\lambda_{u,u}(\\star)&amp;\\coloneqq\\star,&amp;\\operatorname{app}_{u,u}(\\star,\\star)&amp;\\coloneqq\\star,\\\\\n\\operatorname{pair}_{u,u}(\\star,\\star)&amp;\\coloneqq\\star,&amp;\\operatorname{fst}_{u,u}(\\star)&amp;\\coloneqq\\star,\\\\\n\\operatorname{snd}_{u,u}(\\star)&amp;\\coloneqq\\star,&amp;\\operatorname{Eq}_\\Gamma(u,\\star,\\star)&amp;\\coloneqq u,\\\\\n\\operatorname{refl}(u,\\star)&amp;\\coloneqq\\star.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{u\\},&amp;\n\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\star\\},\\\\\nu[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq u,&amp;\\star[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\\star,\\\\\n\\Gamma.u&amp;\\coloneqq\\Gamma,&amp;p_u&amp;\\coloneqq e(\\Gamma),\\\\\nq_u&amp;\\coloneqq\\star,&amp;\\langle\\sigma,\\star\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma,\\\\\n1_\\Gamma&amp;\\coloneqq u,&amp;*_\\Gamma&amp;\\coloneqq\\star,\\\\\n\\Pi_\\Gamma(u,u)&amp;\\coloneqq u,&amp;\\Sigma_\\Gamma(u,u)&amp;\\coloneqq u,\\\\\n\\lambda_{u,u}(\\star)&amp;\\coloneqq\\star,&amp;\\operatorname{app}_{u,u}(\\star,\\star)&amp;\\coloneqq\\star,\\\\\n\\operatorname{pair}_{u,u}(\\star,\\star)&amp;\\coloneqq\\star,&amp;\\operatorname{fst}_{u,u}(\\star)&amp;\\coloneqq\\star,\\\\\n\\operatorname{snd}_{u,u}(\\star)&amp;\\coloneqq\\star,&amp;\\operatorname{Eq}_\\Gamma(u,\\star,\\star)&amp;\\coloneqq u,\\\\\n\\operatorname{refl}(u,\\star)&amp;\\coloneqq\\star.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_\\star\\coloneqq(\\mathcal C,\\operatorname{Ty},\\operatorname{Tm},[-],\\mathbf1,!,(-).(-),p,q,\\langle-,-\\rangle,\n1,*,\\Pi,\\lambda,\\operatorname{app},\\Sigma,\\operatorname{pair},\\operatorname{fst},\\operatorname{snd},\\operatorname{Eq},\\operatorname{refl}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_\\star\\coloneqq(\\mathcal C,\\operatorname{Ty},\\operatorname{Tm},[-],\\mathbf1,!,(-).(-),p,q,\\langle-,-\\rangle,\n1,*,\\Pi,\\lambda,\\operatorname{app},\\Sigma,\\operatorname{pair},\\operatorname{fst},\\operatorname{snd},\\operatorname{Eq},\\operatorname{refl}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nL_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf1\\},\\\\\nL_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq L_n\\cup\\{\\Gamma.A\\mid\\Gamma\\in L_n\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\nG&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}L_n.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nL_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf1\\},\\\\\nL_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq L_n\\cup\\{\\Gamma.A\\mid\\Gamma\\in L_n\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\nG&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}L_n.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SplitDTT}(S_\\star)\\land G=\\{1\\}\\land0\\notin G\\land\\mathcal C(1,0)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SplitDTT}(S_\\star)\\land G=\\{1\\}\\land0\\notin G\\land\\mathcal C(1,0)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\Gamma\\in G\\quad\\neg\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C(0,\\Gamma)\\ \\exists g\\in\\mathcal C(\\Gamma,0)\\quad\n\\bigl(c(g,f)=e(0)\\land c(f,g)=e(\\Gamma)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\Gamma\\in G\\quad\\neg\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C(0,\\Gamma)\\ \\exists g\\in\\mathcal C(\\Gamma,0)\\quad\n\\bigl(c(g,f)=e(0)\\land c(f,g)=e(\\Gamma)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>范畴公理由端点对的合成直接验证：可合成链只有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\le j\\le k\">\\(i\\le j\\le k\\)</span>，三重复合均返回同一对端点，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(i,i)\">\\((i,i)\\)</span> 是恒等。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 是终对象，因为每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C(i,1)\">\\(\\mathcal C(i,1)\\)</span> 都恰有一个元素。</li>\n<li>逐项检查上游六条公理：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf C_1\">\\(\\mathsf C_1\\)</span> 的重索引恒等与合成在单元素类型、项集合中严格成立；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf C_2\">\\(\\mathsf C_2\\)</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_u\">\\(p_u\\)</span> 为恒等，配对就是原箭头，所以两个投影等式及配对唯一性均成立。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf C_3\">\\(\\mathsf C_3\\)</span> 的单位项唯一。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf C_4,\\mathsf C_5\">\\(\\mathsf C_4,\\mathsf C_5\\)</span> 的型属、βη及替换等式的两边分别都是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\star\">\\(\\star\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf C_6\">\\(\\mathsf C_6\\)</span> 中只有相等的两个端点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\star,\\star\">\\(\\star,\\star\\)</span>，相等反射及相等项唯一性也成立。这验证整个记录，而非仅测试几个语法项。</li>\n<li>因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma.u=\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma.u=\\Gamma\\)</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 归纳得到每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_n=\\{1\\}\">\\(L_n=\\{1\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C(1,0)\">\\(\\mathcal C(1,0)\\)</span> 为空，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 不与任何生成语境同构；从生成语境组成的满子范畴到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 的包含并非本质满。</li>\n<li>此例将内部语言往返草稿中的障碍独立形式化：强 split DTT 公理本身不保证基底对象都由空语境有限扩张得到。它不否定加入适当语境生成条件后的内部语言定理，也不证明任何尚未定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Spec}/\\operatorname{Cl}\">\\(\\operatorname{Spec}/\\operatorname{Cl}\\)</span> 往返。例子是本地构造；书中 §10.4 仅提供比较的语境和理解结构背景。</li>\n<li>新建前检索了本书全部原子中的 noncontextual、两个非同构对象及语境生成；只有内部语言草稿的 Remark 含此见证，没有可独立引用的完整构造。这里内建有限范畴和所有结构操作，无需外部原子。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-split-dtt-structure","status":"resolved","id":"b022673471b8fbb9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-split-dtt-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-dtt-structure","status":"resolved","id":"b022673471b8fbb9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[16-df-split-dtt-structure]] 的候选记录格式及谓词 $\\mathsf{SplitDTT}$；本例不预先假定构造的记录满足它。","embe