pp},\\Sigma,\\operatorname{pair},\\operatorname{fst},\\operatorname{snd},\\operatorname{Eq},\\operatorname{refl}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nL_0&\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf1\\},\\\\\nL_{n+1}&\\coloneqq L_n\\cup\\{\\Gamma.A\\mid\\Gamma\\in L_n\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\nG&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}L_n.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SplitDTT}(S_\\star)\\land G=\\{1\\}\\land0\\notin G\\land\\mathcal C(1,0)=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\Gamma\\in G\\quad\\neg\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C(0,\\Gamma)\\ \\exists g\\in\\mathcal C(\\Gamma,0)\\quad\n\\bigl(c(g,f)=e(0)\\land c(f,g)=e(\\Gamma)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"i\\le j\\le k","display":false},{"tex":"(i,i)","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C(i,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf C_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf C_2","display":false},{"tex":"p_u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf C_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf C_4,\\mathsf C_5","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\star","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf C_6","display":false},{"tex":"\\star,\\star","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma.u=\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"L_n=\\{1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C(1,0)","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Spec}/\\operatorname{Cl}","display":false}],"bytes":4913,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-386","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-ex-noncontextual-dtt-model|ex-noncontextual-dtt-model — 强 DTT 结构不保证语境生成]]"},{"id":"788130d97ad6b7a6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-ex-noncontextual-dtt-model]] 说明一般 $\\mathsf{SplitDTT}$ 不能推出 $\\mathsf{CtxDense}$。这里的 $\\simeq_{\\mathrm{pres}}$ 比较分类结构，允许新增可定义符号及真方程；它不宣称重新取内部语言后原始常量名和声明列表不变。该条件和等价层级已经完整写入 Hypothesis 与 Assertion。"}],"outgoing":["b022673471b8fbb9"]}